              "kind": "edit-text",
              "path": "Projects/Flat hunt/Flat hunt.md",
              "text": "---\nsummary: Looking for a two-bed under £1,600 within 30 minutes of the office, moving by 1 December.\nstatus: active\ntags: [project]\nby: bower\nkind: Project\ndue: 1 Dec\nbudget: Up to £1,600 a month\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Three flats on the shortlist; [[Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane]] is the favourite.\n- References are due on Friday.\n- Notice on the current flat must be given by 31 October.\n\n## What matters\n\n- Two bedrooms, one usable as an office\n- Under 30 minutes to work\n- A bike can go inside\n\n## Shortlist\n\n| Flat | Rent | Commute | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [[Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane]] | £1,450 | 24 min | viewing done |\n| [[Flat 7, Cobble Row]] | £1,580 | 18 min | viewing booked |\n| [[Flat 2, 40 Tanners Walk]] | £1,390 | 35 min | maybe |\n\n## Next steps\n\n- [x] Ask the bank for a reference letter\n- [ ] Send references to Kittiwake Lettings by Friday\n- [ ] Give notice on the current flat by 31 October\n- [ ] Book a van for the last weekend of November\n\n## Timeline\n- 28 Sep · Project started from a pile with three listings.\n- 2 Oct · Viewing photos of Larkspur Lane filed. · [[IMG_2290.jpg]]\n- Today · Larkspur Lane moved to \"viewing done\"; references due Friday. · [[Lease draft.pdf]]\n- 2026-10-07 · A fourth flat added; the shortlist compared by commute.\n"
            },
