              "kind": "edit-text",
              "path": "Projects/Job hunt/Job hunt.md",
              "text": "---\nsummary: Looking for a senior design role in Wrenmouth, hybrid, from £55,000; three applications open.\nstatus: active\ntags: [project, career]\nby: bower\nkind: Project\ndue: 31 Dec\n---\n\n## Current state\n- First interview with Lumenfold on Thursday.\n- Quillstone has not answered in 11 days.\n- Skills asked for most often: design for manufacture, sustainable materials, client presentations.\n\n## Applications\n\n| Role | Fit | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [[Senior Product Designer, Lumenfold]] | 8 | interview |\n| [[Design Lead, Quillstone]] | 6 | applied |\n| [[Industrial Designer, Ferrowick]] | 7 | new |\n\n## This week\n\n- [x] Update the CV with the migration project\n- [ ] Prepare the Lumenfold interview story\n- [ ] Chase Quillstone\n\n## Timeline\n- 15 Sep · Project started.\n- 1 Oct · Applied to Lumenfold; fit scored against [[CV insights]].\n- 3 Oct · Interview invitation from Lumenfold. · [[Interview invitation.pdf]]\n- 2026-10-07 · New offer from Ferrowick, scored 7 out of 10 against your CV.\n"
            },
