              "kind": "edit-text",
              "path": "Rules.md",
              "text": "---\nsummary: 4 rules Bower follows in every tidy-up.\nby: bower\nkind: Rules\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- Keep receipts by month. <!-- since 2026-10-07 -->\n  *You wrote: \"Keep receipts by month\"*\n- Receipts and invoices for purchases go to Areas / Money / Receipts, in a folder per month of their date (YYYY-MM). <!-- since 2026-10-06 -->\n  *You wrote: \"receipts to money by month\"*\n- Score every job offer from 1 to 10 against CV insights, list the skills it asks for that the CV lacks, and add a row to the Job hunt table. <!-- since 2026-10-02 -->\n  *You wrote: \"score job offers against my cv and tell me what im missing\"*\n- Passports, ID cards and certificates go to Areas / Documents; tick their line in Passport renewal. Never write document numbers. <!-- since 2026-10-02 -->\n  *You wrote: \"keep my id papers together\"*\n"
            },
